+//   device/faux, dma*, ethtool, firmware, i2c, interrupt, io-pgtable, ioport,
+//   iosys-map, mdio, miscdevice, of_device, pci, phy, platform_device, pm_opp,
+//   property, pwm, regulator, sys_soc, usb, and the samples' rust_sample trace.
