+//!
+//! See our [MSRV policy].
+//!
+//! [MSRV policy]: https://github.com/google/zerocopy/blob/main/POLICIES.md#msrv
+//!
+//! # Changelog
+//!
+//! Zerocopy uses [GitHub Releases].
+//!
+//! [GitHub Releases]: https://github.com/google/zerocopy/releases
+//!
