+/// error[E0277]: the trait bound `(): PaddingFree<Foo, true>` is not satisfied
+///   --> lib.rs:23:10
+///    |
+///  1 | #[derive(IntoBytes)]
+///    |          ^^^^^^^^^ the trait `PaddingFree<Foo, true>` is not implemented for `()`
+///    |
+///    = help: the following implementations were found:
+///                   <() as PaddingFree<T, false>>
